     ## GWAS Workflow Plan                                                      
                                                                                
     Based on the skills loaded, the standard GWAS pipeline for pig data        
     is:                                                                        
                                                                                
     ```                                                                        
     Step 1: Genotype QC (MAF ≥ 0.05)                                           
     Step 2: PLINK Linear GWAS (fast diagnostic)                                
     Step 3: Check genomic inflation (lambda)                                   
     Step 4: If lambda > 1.1 → transition to GCTA MLMA mixed model              
